not deliver: it is discarded and your reviewer is respawned from scratch. Call
`submit_findings` exactly once, as soon as your review is complete. If it comes
back with an error, read it, fix the arguments and call it again — you are still
running and can still correct yourself. Afterwards you may summarise your
reasoning in prose, for the human.

